<task id="Disabling_Special_Offers_with_Windows" xml:lang="en-us">
   <title>Disabling Special Offers with Windows</title>
   <shortdesc>You can disable special offers messages from MetR using a utility on your Windows computer.</shortdesc>
  <prolog>
    <metadata>
      <keywords>
        <keyword>Windows</keyword>
        <keyword>placeholder</keyword>
        <keyword>Offers</keyword>
        <keyword>right</keyword>
        <keyword>click</keyword>
        <keyword>Disabling</keyword>
        <indexterm>Windows</indexterm>
        <indexterm>placeholder</indexterm>
        <indexterm>Offers</indexterm>
      </keywords>
      <prodinfo>
        <prodname></prodname>
      </prodinfo>
    </metadata>
  </prolog>
   <taskbody>
      <context>
         <p>You can disable special offers messages from MetR using a utility on your Windows computer.</p>
      </context>
      <steps id="steps_05013251">
         <step>
            <cmd>Access the Windows Desktop and right-click the <image height="19" href="../media/image147.png" placement="break" width="19">
                  <alt>placeholder</alt>
               </image> icon for your product in the right side of the Windows taskbar, or click the up arrow and right-click <image height="19" href="../media/image147.png" placement="break" width="19">
                  <alt>placeholder</alt>
               </image>. Select <b>Monitoring Preferences</b>.</cmd>
            <info>
               <p>You see this window:</p>
               <fig>
                  <title>placeholder</title>
                  <image height="463" href="../media/image151.jpeg" placement="break" width="360">
                     <alt>placeholder</alt>
                  </image>
               </fig>
            </info>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>To disable promotional offers, deselect the <b>Display</b>
               <b>MetR</b>
               <b>Offers</b>checkbox.</cmd>
         </step>
      </steps>
   </taskbody>
</task>
